# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in to turn on crash reporting.
# Devot reads only this name; a generic SENTRY_DSN from another project is ignored.
# Cargo watches this file only while it exists: after creating it for the first
# time, run `touch src-tauri/build.rs` once so the next build picks it up.
DEVOT_SENTRY_DSN=

# Release builds upload the UI's source maps and the app's debug symbols to
# Sentry when all three are set (see docs/architecture.md, Crash reporting).
# SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=
# SENTRY_ORG=
# SENTRY_PROJECT=
